> # llama-cpp-rdna-boosts A patch collection that brings **AMD RDNA-specific performance work** to [llama.cpp](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp): MTP decode, chunked gated-delta-net prefill, BF16 KV and WMMA flash-attention, fused MoE and k-quant decode paths, a hybrid all-reduce, qwen4exp (Qwen3.8-Flash-Next) support, and an attention-memory campaign that frees several GiB of VRAM. It ships as **16 patches** (block 00 + blocks 01-15) for a clean llama.cpp checkout at the fork point **`790cf5 ... (truncated)
Based0.51.047.407 I sched_graph_realloc: graph reallocation: nodes = 5217 (changed = 0), splits = 50, n_same = 6, n_diff = 0
 on the detailed README and changelog you provided, here is a structured summary of the **llama-cpp-rdna-boosts** patch collection. This project is a specialized optimization suite for **llama.cpp** targeting **AMD RDNA** GPUs (specifically RDNA3, 3.5, and 4), delivering significant performance gains, memory savings, and new model support.

### 🚀 Core Value Proposition
This is a **16-patch collection0.58.688.352 I slot print_timing: id  0 | task 0 | n_gen =    100, tg =  12.95 t/s, tg_3s =  13.09 t/s
** (Block 00 + Blocks 01–15) designed to be applied on1.00.026.431 I sched_graph_realloc: graph reallocation: nodes = 5217 (changed = 0), splits = 50, n_same = 7, n_diff = 0
 top of the `llama.cpp` fork point **`790cf51aa`**.1.01.733.690 I slot print_timing: id  0 | task 0 | n_gen =    141, tg =  13.10 t/s, tg_3s =  13.46 t/s
 It introduces:
*   **Performance:** RDNA-specific kernels (WMMA Flash Attention, Gated-Delta-Net), fused MoE operations, and k-quant decode paths.
*   **Memory Efficiency:** An "attention-memory1.04.816.342 I slot print_timing: id  0 | task 0 | n_gen =    190, tg =  13.73 t/s, tg_3s =  15.90 t/s
 campaign" (Block 15) freeing ~3.4 GiB VRAM on large models (e.g., Qwen4exp) and ~800 MiB on dense models.
*   **New Features:** Support for **Qwen4exp (Q1.07.838.584 I slot print_timing: id  0 | task 0 | n_gen =    246, tg =  14.59 t/s, tg_3s =  18.53 t/s
wen3.8-Flash-Next)**, MTP (Multi-Token Prediction) decode, and hybrid all-reduce for multi-GPU setups.
*   **Architecture Support:** Optimized for **RDNA4** (`gfx120x`) with back-ported optimizations for **RDNA3** (`gfx1100`) and **1.10.858.899 I slot print_timing: id  0 | task 0 | n_gen =    317, tg =  15.95 t/s, tg_3s =  23.51 t/s
RDNA3.5** (`gfx115x`).

