### ⚙️ Architecture & Compatibility

*   **Target Families:**
    *   **RDNA 4 (`gfx1200`/`gfx1201`):** Maximum benefit1.35.055.978 I slot print_timing: id  0 | task 0 | n_gen =   1036, tg =  23.52 t/s, tg_3s =  32.17 t/s
 (WMMA Flash-Attn, Chunked-GDN, k-quant VDR, Block 12 All-Reduce).
