    *   **RDNA 3 (`gfx1100`):** RX 7900/7800 series. Back-ported kernels1.38.056.179 I slot print_timing: id  0 | task 0 | n_gen =   1140, tg =  24.23 t/s, tg_3s =  34.66 t/s
.
